00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.130
You hit the jackpot! Congratulations!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.510
Jack\h\h\hpot

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.510
Here!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.510
Jack pot

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.390
How luxurious! Bitter and sweet at the same time.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.890
Oh, you!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.190
All right, Nori, you're next.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.810
Oh, thanks.

