Hobbies

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.820
Hobbies? Hm, my hobbies...

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.430
Lately, I've been into computers.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:33.430
CG and HTML and a bit of Flash.

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:36.830
I'm broke, so I download a lot of freeware.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.330
Lately...

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.460
Broke...

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:42.250
Huh?

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:48.080
Oh, that's right, you didn't have a net connection here until I came.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.270
Sorry for not understanding you.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.380
Thanks for bringing us enlightenment!

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:56.490
But I'm a bit disappointed I couldn't get a fiber optic line here.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:59.140
I was looking forward to that, so now it feels slow.

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:00.890
Like the Kodama?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.520
Okay, you go next, Yuno.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:07.650
Okay.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.650
Nazuna asks us a question!!

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:11.740
You mean I have to?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.650
Yeah!

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.430
Well, um...

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:18.040
Why do you draw?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:22.040
Why? That's pretty deep.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.460
You rolled, Yuno, so you go first.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.250
Why do I draw?

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.710
Why... Why...

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.340
Why...

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.510
Hey, Yuno!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.260
Maybe you have another question?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.600
Sorry! Um, um, is school fun?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.730
Yeah, it's fun!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.230
The work is interesting.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.110
The atmosphere there is peaceful.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.150
There's this one really fun teacher. She's always wearing weird clothes.

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:57.320
She's got a great rack and likes to strip.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:07:59.950
Huh?

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.210
It's already 9:00!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.820
Shall we wind things down?

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.340
You guys have your entrance ceremony tomorrow.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.530
Sure.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:13.260
Thanks, it was great.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.720
Oh, you could have just left it on the table.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:20.970
Um, Yuno, do you mind if I ask another question?

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:28.730
Isn't living alone lonely?

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.480
No, not at all.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:37.030
Thanks! Good night!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.620
Thanks!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.990
Good night!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.990
I think we flustered them a bit.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.120
Yeah.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.830
We didn't get to talk that much.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:53.740
Don't worry. We have all the time in the world.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.130
Yeah.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.130
Introduce
Yourself

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.130
Well then...

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:56.220
Things we can
talk about now

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.890
Let's start round two!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.760
Things we can
talk about now

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.760
Just us!?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.940
It's already this late?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.770
We overslept.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.260
It's because we went to bed so late.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.530
Yeah.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:18.910
When I was little, I used to be able to get up early even after staying up all night.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:22.410
I can't believe I used to do radio gymnastics.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.910
Morning. I'm hungry.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.500
Good morning, Miya.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:34.380
Are we gonna do radio gymnastics? That'll just make me hungrier.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.710
Sorry to bother you!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.930
Big news, everyone!

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:44.020
Oh no.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.930
If we don't get going to the entrance ceremony...

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.690
No, I just came back from that.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.440
Oh, sorry.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.920
Hiro...

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.690
So, what's up?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.240
Oh, right. Nazuna!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.080
She's in Gen Ed!?

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.380
I live around here,

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:21.250
so I got into Yamabuki's Gen Ed program because I wanted somewhere close.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:25.140
After that, Dad suddenly got transferred.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:34.770
But he's not good at taking care of himself, so Mom went with him.

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:38.610
And I can't do anything.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:43.200
I can't cook, and I'm bad at cleaning.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.870
I'm no good at drawing, and I don't have any skills or hobbies.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.790
They didn't seem like that.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.170
Come on, what are you worrying about?

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.590
There are plenty of things you're good at.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.930
Nori...

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.300
I just don't know what they are yet.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.060
How honest.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.090
So, she's in Gen Ed.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:20.200
I guess that's what she meant by, "Why do you draw?"

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.070
I wonder why none of us realized.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:25.180
Because no one asked?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:30.540
I guess. I just figured anyone coming here would be in the art department.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.960
It is pretty rare. Maybe a first for Hidamari Apartments?

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.420
I wonder if she'll be okay living alone all of a sudden.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:41.050
She was expecting to live at home, right?

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.550
I feel sorry for her after hearing how it happened.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:47.550
It'll be fine. She'll get used to it.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.060
I hope so.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:54.350
I should ask where she gets her hair done!

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.900
The braiding?

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.440
Yeah. I like the cut too.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.820
She lived nearby, so probably the place by the station.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.070
You mean Olive?

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.330
Olive? That brings back memories.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.950
When did we go there, Miya?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.080
It was when I tried barbecuing, so...

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.000
Last summer!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.000
April 6th~7th

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.000
The end

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.000
To be continued

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:22.010
July 19th
"Olive"\h\h\h\h

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.360
Miya!?

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.870
Miya, what's wrong? Are you okay?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.870
Sorry, I'm fine.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:54.870
I tried to barbecue over the burner, and it got a little crispy.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.880
Now the meat's all charred.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.260
Oh man, it's scorched.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:06.840
You're lucky you didn't get burned.

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:11.350
Hey, Miya, let's go to a salon.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:14.100
I'd been thinking about going for a while anyway.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.690
A salon?

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:21.190
Lately, I've just been having my older brother do it.

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:23.820
Your older brother is a friseur?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.820
No, he's a gardener.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.340
A tree!?

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:31.830
My favorite salon?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.830
How about Olive? It's right by the station.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.450
Olive?

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:39.050
Sae and I always go there.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:44.380
Hold on, they gave me half-off coupons for new customers.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.880
Thanks.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:57.140
Sorry, could you hold on a bit?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.520
Huh? Um...

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:02.200
Hiro, are those all point cards?

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.440
You're such a housewife.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:04.860
There they are!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.360
Here.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.350
Thanks.

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.360
I'm grateful.

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.920
Wow, what a cute shop.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.250
It's so tidy.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.510
Welcome!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.900
It's nice and cool.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.710
It's bringing me back to life.

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.350
Aren't twin hairdressers unusual?

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.320
Sorry we surprised you.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.150
No, it's wonderful.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:52.290
This place is so cute.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.580
The name Olive is great too.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:00.750
We actually got the name from our own.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.830
From your names?

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:05.540
So you're Ollie and Boo?

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:06.670
Boo!?

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:10.970
Our family name is Oribe.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.970
Ori

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:12.970
be

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.030
I'm so sorry.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.100
Don't worry.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.350
All right, I'm taking these off.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.270
Okay.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:24.490
Are you just in for a cut? How would you like it?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:29.320
I'm fine with the length. Just even it out.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.490
I know! Make me look grown-up!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.620
That'll be tough.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.580
What kind of cut would you like?

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.660
Make me a classical beauty.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.080
How am I supposed to...

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:49.090
All right, we'll start with a shampoo and treatment.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.200
Okay.

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.340
Sorry, is it too hot?

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.930
No, it just tickles.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.560
Right, Miya?

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.480
Um, what's she doing?

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:11.440
She's probably ticklish.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.230
All right, let's start cutting.

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:17.820
Do your best!

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:21.200
First, I'm going to raise the chair.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.700
Me too.

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:25.960
This is fun.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:29.290
I haven't worn a poncho like this in a while.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.210
I'm like a teruteru bouzu.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:43.770
Wow, you're so skillful.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.040
Thanks. Shall I thin it a little in the back?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:48.650
Sure.

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.190
Would you like your hair thinned too?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:52.780
Yes.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.300
Do you usually get it thinned?

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:57.410
Yes, all the time.

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.120
How much should I thin it?

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.410
A lot. I'm starving.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:03.910
Starving?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:10.300
All right, I'm starting the dryer. If it gets too hot, just say something.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.530
Okay!

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.940
Miya!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.500
What did you do?

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:39.320
My hair's just like this.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:42.930
When it gets a rinse and some treatment, it does this.

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:45.580
You should buy those more often! You're great!

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:50.180
All right, it's done.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:52.000
Thanks.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:55.880
Yuno...

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.510
cchi

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.680
I'll be waiting.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.630
Okay.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.120
The sun's setting.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.390
Ah, sorry.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:04.900
Shall I shut the blinds?

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.520
No, I'm fine.

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:09.520
All done!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.270
Do you like it?

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.150
Yeah, thanks.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.270
Want to take a look at the back too?

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:20.150
Sure.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:40.300
Thank you!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.420
Please come again.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.980
Miya, you look completely different!

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.560
What did you do, get a straightening?

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.500
No, just a treatment.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.110
Huh?

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:07.840
It's so nice that way. Maybe I should get a straight perm next time.

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:12.000
I'm sure a lot of people are jealous of curly hair like yours.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.250
But Miya, you look so mature.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.380
Yeah.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.010
It'll be back to normal in a few days.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.510
Um...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.510
Do I also look more mature?

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:26.640
Sure.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:32.270
It smells like a salon in here now.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.270
Really?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:37.170
Yeah. It's that nice smell that salons have.

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:40.940
Maybe I should get mine cut too.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.710
I'm a bit worried about how long it's gotten.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.750
Why not have me cut it?

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:49.500
I think I can do it now.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.460
Knock it off! You're talking about someone's head here!

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:54.960
Then how about me?

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.710
You too?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.360
I guess I can get away with not washing my hair today.

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:28.200
It still smells like a salon.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:35.460
I look a bit more mature, right?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.370
Right?

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:39.960
July 19th
The end

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:39.960
To be continued

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:47.220
I can't
wait to
teach you
this year
too!

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:47.220
Good
morning!

00:20:39.990 --> 00:21:09.820
Next Episode

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:43.460
So, you first years already know all about Yamabuki?

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.100
No, not yet.

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.720
Me either. There's still plenty I don't know.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:54.720
These
are
your
new
seating
assignments.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.640
The Seven Wonders of Yamabuki High.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.900
There's a forbidden classroom!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.900
You mean the one the new students disappeared from?

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:55.980
Really!?

00:20:54.940 --> 00:21:02.240
How did
you come
up with
these?

00:20:54.940 --> 00:21:02.240
Tee-hee.
Fill in
the boys'
seats and
you'll
see.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.140
It's just a rumor.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:05.080
Next time, "April 8th~9th: Decision" and "December 10th: Because the Cup Is Small."

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:09.000
We'll be waiting at Yamabuki High. Be sure to come see us!
